    "summary": "Perennial woody shrub endemic to Madeira Island. Its flower heads combine reddish-purple disc flowers that turn yellow after opening with pinkish-white outer flowers. This rare plant grows on moist, rocky coastal slopes of Madeira and the Desertas Islands.",
