    "taxonId": 136884,
    "summary": "Small conifer tree native to the mountain forests of São Tomé Island in the Gulf of Guinea. It is the only gymnosperm found on São Tomé and Príncipe. Vigorous young trees have larger lance-shaped leaves, and each highly modified seed cone carries one seed with a thin fleshy coating.",
