    "taxonId": 346386,
    "summary": "Flowering palm native to the mountainous forests of India and Bhutan, typically growing on cliffs and hillsides. Its trunk is usually clear of old leaf bases except near the crown, and its feather-like leaves have fewer, less severe spines than other Phoenix species. The yellow-to-orange fruit contains one large seed.",
